    "backend:module:personnel_detail_contract::fdf7600cca980d83::foundation": {
      "id": "backend:module:personnel_detail_contract::fdf7600cca980d83::foundation",
      "unit_id": "backend:module:personnel_detail_contract",
      "owner": "backend",
      "task_type": "backend.code",
      "title": "模块基础骨架 · 人员明细数据库基础设施",
      "description": "1. 人员明细领域实体，对应 personnel 表。\n字段：id(Long，主键)、name(String，姓名，非空)、gender(String)、phone(String)、email(String)、department(String)、hireDate(LocalDate，映射 hire_date)、remark(String)。\n纯数据容器，不包含业务处理逻辑。（backend/src/main/java/com/cmbchina/backend/domain/entity/Personnel.java）\n2. 人员明细持久化对象。\n字段与表映射：id → id(BIGINT，自增主键)、name → name(VARCHAR(100)，非空)、gender → gender(VARCHAR(8))、phone → phone(VARCHAR(32))、email → email(VARCHAR(128))、department → department(VARCHAR(128))、hireDate → hire_date(DATE)、remark → remark(TEXT)。\n使用 MyBatis-Plus 注解声明表名 personnel 与主键映射，不包含业务逻辑。（backend/src/main/java/com/cmbchina/backend/infrastructure/po/PersonnelPO.java）\n3. 人员明细 Mapper 接口，继承 BaseMapper<PersonnelPO>，使用单表分页/计数能力，无需自定义 XML。（backend/src/main/java/com/cmbchina/backend/infrastructure/mapper/PersonnelMapper.java）\n4. 人员明细仓储接口。\n方法：PageResult<Personnel> pageQuery(int current, int pageSize)，按页码与每页条数分页返回人员明细，包含总条数与当前页数据。\n不引入基础设施或应用层 DTO 类型。（backend/src/main/java/com/cmbchina/backend/domain/repository/PersonnelRepository.java）\n5. PO 与领域实体转换器。\n方法：Personnel toEntity(PersonnelPO po)、List<Personnel> toEntities(List<PersonnelPO> pos)。\n字段逐一同名映射：id、name、gender、phone、email、department、hireDate、remark。（backend/src/main/java/com/cmbchina/backend/infrastructure/repository/converter/PersonnelPoConverter.java）\n6. 人员明细仓储实现，注入 PersonnelMapper 与 PersonnelPoConverter。\npageQuery 处理逻辑：使用 Page<PersonnelPO> 与 LambdaQueryWrapper 按 id 排序分页查询，统计 total，将记录通过 PersonnelPoConverter 转为领域实体，封装为 PageResult<Personnel> 返回。\n边界约束：PO、MyBatis Page 不出基础设施层。（backend/src/main/java/com/cmbchina/backend/infrastructure/repository/impl/PersonnelRepositoryImpl.java）",
      "dependencies": [
        "backend:bootstrap::database::bootstrap"
      ],
      "target_files": [
        "backend/src/main/java/com/cmbchina/backend/domain/entity/Personnel.java",
        "backend/src/main/java/com/cmbchina/backend/infrastructure/po/PersonnelPO.java",
        "backend/src/main/java/com/cmbchina/backend/infrastructure/mapper/PersonnelMapper.java",
        "backend/src/main/java/com/cmbchina/backend/domain/repository/PersonnelRepository.java",
        "backend/src/main/java/com/cmbchina/backend/infrastructure/repository/converter/PersonnelPoConverter.java",
        "backend/src/main/java/com/cmbchina/backend/infrastructure/repository/impl/PersonnelRepositoryImpl.java"
      ],
      "allowed_paths": [
